   b. "Account" means an account with the Service on any plan, including the free plan, that is in good standing under the Flight Data Terms of Service.
   c. "Licensee" means you, if you hold an Account, or the organization you act for, if it holds one.
   d. "Application" means software made by or for a Licensee.

2. What a Licensee may do. While it holds an Account, Diradical grants each Licensee a worldwide, non-exclusive, non-transferable, royalty-free license to:
