   c. keep a copy of the Software's source, public or private, modified or not, to maintain changes to it or to propose them to Diradical, as long as this license and the copyright notice stay with it.

3. Work for clients. If you build an Application for a client that is a Licensee, you may use the Software under section 2 on the client's behalf. The Application must send its reports to the client's Account.

4. What no one may do. You may not:
   a. use the Software, or any part or modification of it, to send reports to, or receive them from, any service other than the Service;
