   Nothing in this license restricts anyone from reading the Software or its documentation.

5. When rights end.
   a. A Licensee's rights continue for 90 days after its Account is closed, so that it can release builds of its Applications without the Software, and then end. After that, it may not distribute new builds of an Application that contains the Software. Copies of Applications already in people's hands may keep running.
